{"id":"5591939bd3612ac0","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-compact-riemann-surface.md","title":"Compact Riemann Surface","display":"df-compact-riemann-surface — Compact Riemann Surface","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-compact-riemann-surface","aliases":["58-df-compact-riemann-surface","Compact Riemann Surface"],"display":"df-compact-riemann-surface — Compact Riemann Surface","depends_on":["[[../batch05/58-df-riemann-surface.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-compact.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-compact-riemann-surface"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-compact-riemann-surface</span><span>Compact Riemann Surface</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-compact-riemann-surface — Compact Riemann Surface"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"40b3e2c20a74165b\" href=\"?note=40b3e2c20a74165b\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-riemann-surface.md\">../batch05/58-df-riemann-surface.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"050f6d05b2c94aea\" href=\"?note=050f6d05b2c94aea\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-compact.md\">../batch05/58-df-compact.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau,\\mathcal A\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau,\\mathcal A\\in V\\)</span> (carrier, topology, and complex atlas)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RiemannSurface}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{RiemannSurface}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Compact}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Compact}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (predicates from dependencies)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompactRiemannSurfaceStructure}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{CompactRiemannSurfaceStructure}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompactRiemannSurface}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{CompactRiemannSurface}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (explicit predicate and compatibility projection defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}compact\\text{-}riemann\\text{-}surface\\text{-}structure} \\vdash \\mathrm{CompactRiemannSurfaceStructure}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{RiemannSurface}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal A)\\land\\mathrm{Compact}_S(X,\\tau)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}compact\\text{-}riemann\\text{-}surface\\text{-}structure} \\vdash \\mathrm{CompactRiemannSurfaceStructure}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{RiemannSurface}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal A)\\land\\mathrm{Compact}_S(X,\\tau)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}compact\\text{-}riemann\\text{-}surface} \\vdash \\mathrm{CompactRiemannSurface}_S(X)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\tau,\\mathcal A\\in V\\;\\mathrm{CompactRiemannSurfaceStructure}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}compact\\text{-}riemann\\text{-}surface} \\vdash \\mathrm{CompactRiemannSurface}_S(X)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\tau,\\mathcal A\\in V\\;\\mathrm{CompactRiemannSurfaceStructure}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Compact Riemann surface: a Riemann-surface atlas whose own topology is compact; both upstream predicates now receive their exact arguments.</li>\n<li>Uniformization: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X \\cong \\mathbb{H}/\\Gamma\">\\(X \\cong \\mathbb{H}/\\Gamma\\)</span>; covered by upper half-plane</li>\n<li>Jacobian: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Jac}(X) = H^0(X,K)^* / H_1(X,\\mathbb{Z})\">\\(\\operatorname{Jac}(X) = H^0(X,K)^* / H_1(X,\\mathbb{Z})\\)</span>; complex torus of dimension <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span></li>\n<li>Moduli: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{M}_g\">\\(\\mathcal{M}_g\\)</span> of dimension <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"3g-3\">\\(3g-3\\)</span> for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g \\geq 2\">\\(g \\geq 2\\)</span>; Teichmüller space</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Farkas and Kra, Riemann Surfaces</li>\n<li>Miranda, Algebraic Curves and Riemann Surfaces</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch05/58-df-riemann-surface.md","status":"resolved","id":"40b3e2c20a74165b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-riemann-surface.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-compact.md","status":"resolved","id":"050f6d05b2c94aea","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-compact.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\tau,\\mathcal A\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RiemannSurface}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Compact}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CompactRiemannSurfaceStructure}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CompactRiemannSurface}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}compact\\text{-}riemann\\text{-}surface\\text{-}structure} \\vdash \\mathrm{CompactRiemannSurfaceStructure}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{RiemannSurface}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal A)\\land\\mathrm{Compact}_S(X,\\tau)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}compact\\text{-}riemann\\text{-}surface} \\vdash \\mathrm{CompactRiemannSurface}_S(X)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\tau,\\mathcal A\\in V\\;\\mathrm{CompactRiemannSurfaceStructure}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal A)","display":true},{"tex":"X \\cong \\mathbb{H}/\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Jac}(X) = H^0(X,K)^* / H_1(X,\\mathbb{Z})","display":false},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{M}_g","display":false},{"tex":"3g-3","display":false},{"tex":"g \\geq 2","display":false}],"bytes":1762,"backlinks":[{"id":"fd304c64ff2b4cf0","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"9ae082208bc5fc2b","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-321","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-compact-riemann-surface.md|58-df-compact-riemann-surface]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["40b3e2c20a74165b","050f6d05b2c94aea"]}